  "result": "Viewers no longer hold a seat anywhere in Taskflow. The full suite passes (625 tests, up from 617), and `tsc --noEmit` and eslint are clean on the touched files.\n\nLeft as-is: the invite-accept page (`src/app/(auth)/invite/[token]/page.tsx`) still says accepting \"takes up one of its seats\", which is wrong for a viewer invite. `memberCount` in the org summary now counts billable members only, since it shares `countActiveMembers`.\n\nTwo fixes beyond the spec, both needed for the counter to agree with a recount:\n- Org creation counted the owner twice, because the recount ran before the join event added the seat. The recount now runs after it.\n- `findMemberById` returned archived members, so removing someone twice decremented the counter twice. It now excludes them, matching the repository's stated rule.",
